<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – Secretsource</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/tags/secretsource/</link><description>Recent content in Secretsource on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/tags/secretsource/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>secretsource — 참조에서 비밀 가져오기</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/libraries/secretsource/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/libraries/secretsource/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;파일에 남겨 두면 안 되는 PIN은 어디에서 가져오는가?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;참조&lt;/strong&gt;는 비밀이 있는
곳을 가리키고, &lt;code&gt;secretsource.Open&lt;/code&gt;이 그것을 가져옵니다. 참조에는 비밀이 들어
있지 않으므로 플래그, 스크립트, 셸 기록에 있어도 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go get github.com/go-authn/secretsource@v0.2.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;secretsource&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ctx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;keepassxc:by-path/Keys/Yubikey PIN&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;defer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Close&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// overwrites the bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;참조&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;읽는 대상&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;file:PATH&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;소유자만 읽을 수 있는 일반 파일(모드 0600 이하); 끝의 줄바꿈 하나는 제거됩니다&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keychain:SERVICE/ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;macOS 키체인의 일반 암호 항목&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;secretservice:SERVICE/ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;속성 &lt;code&gt;service=SERVICE&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;account=ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;를 가진 freedesktop Secret Service 항목 (GNOME Keyring, KWallet, KeePassXC의 Secret Service 연동)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;secretservice:KEY=VALUE[,KEY=VALUE...]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;그 속성을 모두 가진 단 하나의 Secret Service 항목; 여러 개가 일치하면 거부됩니다&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keepassxc:by-uuid/HEX&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;해당 UUID(16진수 32자리)의 KeePassXC 항목&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keepassxc:by-path/Group/Title&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;해당 경로의 항목(루트 그룹 이름은 생략); 두 그룹이 같은 제목을 가지면 모호하다고 거부되므로 &lt;code&gt;by-uuid/&lt;/code&gt;를 쓰세요&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keepassxc:URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;URL 필드가 일치하는 항목&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;명령을 실행하는 스킴은 없습니다&lt;/strong&gt;: 플래그가 프로세스를 시작할 수 있어서는 안
되기 때문입니다. 스킴이 없는 참조는 경로로 추측되지 않고 거부됩니다(경로는&lt;code&gt;file:&lt;/code&gt;로 씁니다). 4096바이트보다 긴 비밀이나 관리자가 돌려준 빈 비밀은
거부되며, 호출은 컨텍스트(기한이 없으면 2분)와 함께 끝납니다. 관리자가 잠금
해제를 기다리고 있어도 마찬가지입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="keepassxc"&gt;KeePassXC&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="keepassxc"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#keepassxc" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;KeePassXC는 브라우저 통합 프로토콜로 연결합니다(macOS와 Linux; Windows는 아직
구현되지 않았습니다).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;KeePassXC에서 &lt;em&gt;Settings &amp;gt; Browser Integration&lt;/em&gt;을 켭니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터베이스마다 한 번 이 컴퓨터를 연결하고 KeePassXC에서 승인합니다:
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go install github.com/go-authn/secretsource/cmd/secretsource@latest
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource keepassxc associate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비밀을 출력하지 않고 참조를 확인합니다:
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource check &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;keepassxc:by-path/Yubikey PIN&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;항목을 처음 읽을 때 KeePassXC의 접근 대화 상자가 나타납니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;fido --pin-from&lt;/code&gt;(&lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/libraries/fido/"&gt;fido&lt;/a&gt; 참고)과&lt;code&gt;theca --pin-from&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--password-from&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--recovery-from&lt;/code&gt;이 사용합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="reference"&gt;참조 문서&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="reference"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#reference" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;이 페이지의 기준은&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-authn/secretsource" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;github.com/go-authn/secretsource&lt;/a&gt;의
README입니다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>